# Nothing here is needed to run the API, and some of it must not leave this
# machine. `uploads/` in particular holds product photographs and pictures
# customers attached to import requests — on Vercel those live in the Blob
# store, and shipping the local copies would both bloat the deployment and
# push customer data somewhere it was never meant to go.
node_modules
uploads
dist
test
coverage
*.spec.ts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backups
